      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FAST CAR (7) has a strong record this trip with three wins and four placings from eight starts. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (24.45) in a Grade 4/5 over 435m at Sale. Rates on top and should go close. SAXON KELTON (8) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 2 lengths into second (20.04) at this track in a Grade 5 over 350m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Can feature again. PAW NIALL (2) is long overdue for a win and in super consistent form, jumping from this box to place last time at Horsham (27.53), making it three straight minors. Has the ability and looks a key chance. GALLOPING HAPPY (5) is a chance after winning last time.",
